    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d351">

                <pb facs="0946" n="732" xml:id="pg732"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 330.</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Mr. Fish to Mr.
                        Motley</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1870-11-17"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >November</hi> 17, 1870.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Motley</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Minister</hi>,<hi rendition="#italic"> London:</hi></p>
                <p>Send Sickles by mail and telegraph this. Your number 172 received. Course fully
                    approved. Insist firmly and vigorously on our plan for adjusting and settling
                    claims as shown in your note to Sagasta.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>FISH, <hi rendition="#italic">Secretary.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
